# Passwordless sudo for the xinstall installer menu (default on fresh
# installs). The menu re-executes itself under sudo (require_root), so
# members of the 'sudo' group get NOPASSWD for exactly these paths - not a
# blanket passwordless sudo. Installer scripts invoked from the menu already
# run as root, so only the menu entry point needs the rule.
# Mode 0440 root-owned is enforced at install time by the preseed late_command.
%sudo ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/bin/xinstall, /usr/local/lib/xinstall/*